Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 05:31:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(pub_api): designs by circuit module, min_stars / eda
 filters, footprint in part lists

For Tindie Discover (Open hardware by module; only openable KiCad/Eagle designs with >=1 star;
PCB planner lists only parts that have a footprint).

- GET /api/pub/v1/designs?function=<module id> (includes sub-modules, via oshw_bom_modules)
- min_stars, eda (comma separated) filters applied before paging, so totals stay correct
- parts/search and parts/lookup items carry footprint (withheld when it has a pending conflict);
  with_footprint=1 returns only parts with a footprint

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018MWFKK7DmS3uJmhqWTQfJ4
---
 ezplm_pilot/pub_api.py | 69 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 tests/test_pub_api.py  | 39 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 98 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ezplm_pilot/pub_api.py b/ezplm_pilot/pub_api.py
